y-500 mt-0.5\">Please review your performance summary before submitting the test.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Summary Table */}\n              <div className=\"overflow-x-auto border border-gray-200 rounded-xl mb-6 shadow-sm\">\n                <table className=\"min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200 text-left\">\n                  <thead className=\"bg-gray-50\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <th scope=\"col\" className=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider\">Section Name</th>\n                      <th scope=\"col\" className=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider text-center\">Total Qs</th>\n                      <th scope=\"col\" className=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider text-center\">Attempted</th>\n                      <th scope=\"col\" className=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider text-center\">Not Attempted</th>\n                      <th scope=\"col\" className=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider text-center\">Not Visited</th>\n                      <th scope=\"col\" className=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider text-center\">Marked</th>\n                      <th scope=\"col\" className=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider text-center\">Time Spent</th>\n                    </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody className=\"bg-white divide-y divide-gray-100\">\n                    {summaryData.sectionSummaries.map((sec, i) => (\n                      <tr key={i} className=\"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors\">\n                        <td className=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900\">{sec.section}</td>\n                        <td className=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600 text-center font-medium\">{sec.total}</td>\n                        <td className=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-center\">\n                          <span className=\"inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-green-50 text-green-700 border border-green-100\">\n                            {sec.attempted}\n                          </span>\n                        </td>\n                        <td className=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-center\">\n                          <span className=\"inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-red-50 text-red-700 border border-red-100\">\n                            {sec.notAttempted}\n                          </span>\n                        </td>\n                        <td className=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-center\">\n                          <span className=\"inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 border border-gray-200\">\n                            {sec.notVisited}\n                          </span>\n                        </td>\n                        <td className=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-center\">\n                          <span className=\"inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-100\">\n                            {sec.marked}\n                          </span>\n                        </td>\n                        <td className=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-center font-semibold text-gray-700\">\n                          {Math.floor(sec.timeSpent / 60)}m {sec.timeSpent % 60}s\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    ))}\n                    {/* Total Row */}\n                    <tr className=\"bg-indigo-50/40 font-bold border-t-2 border-indigo-100\">\n                      <td className=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-indigo-950 font-bold\">Total</td>\n                      <td className=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-indigo-950 text-center font-bold\">{summaryData.grandTotal.total}</td>\n                      <td className=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-center\">\n                        <span className=\"inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-green-100 text-green-800 border border-green-200\">\n                          {summaryData.grandTotal.attempted}\n                        </span>\n                      </td>\n                      <td className=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-center\">\n                        <span className=\"inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-red-100 text-red-800 border border-red-200\">\n                          {summaryData.grandTotal.notAttempted}\n                        </span>\n                      </td>\n                      <td className=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-center\">\n                        <span className=\"inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-gray-200 text-gray-800 border border-gray-300\">\n                          {summaryData.grandTotal.notVisited}\n                        </span>\n                      </td>\n                      <td className=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-center\">\n                        <span className=\"inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 border border-purple-200\">\n                          {summaryData.grandTotal.marked}\n                        </span>\n                      </td>\n                      <td className=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-center font-bold text-indigo-950\">\n                        {Math.floor(summaryData.grandTotal.timeSpent / 60)}m {summaryData.grandTotal.timeSpent % 60}s\n                      </td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"bg-yellow-50/80 border border-yellow-100 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6 flex items-start gap-3\">\n                <AlertTriangle classN